WEBVTT

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:48.390
Excuse me.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:57.130
Kokushuu Governor Kai, I assume?

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:04.030
Pleased to meet you. I am the governor of Sashuu...

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:05.650
Kou Shuurei-dono, right?

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:08.170
Yes.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:12.790
I did not expect to become a colleague of such a young,

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:16.870
attractive, cultured and talented woman after growing so old.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.320
I am fortunate.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:24.550
If he was 30 years younger, even I might have lost my heart to him... huh?

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:33.980
This is Kokushuu's speciality, a product called Kuro-imo-youkan.

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:36.460
Please have some.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.720
Ah! I can pour the tea for you.

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:42.520
I have invited you,

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.720
so please sit down and make yourself comfortable.

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:57.690
It's delicious!

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.110
I am glad.

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:06.940
By the way, do you know of Eigetsu-kun... Governor To?

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.620
I work with another person as governor of Sashuu.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:15.130
I heard that the other person, To Eigetsu, is from Kokushuu.

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:19.000
Yes, I know him well.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:20.630
So, just as I thought.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:27.170
I accommodated Governor To in my residence,
as he passed the Kokushuu exam with top grades,

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:31.640
and acted as his guardian until he left for the final national exam.

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:33.400
His guardian?

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.780
Governor To had a letter with him.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:42.410
The sender was Doushu of Suikyu temple in Seika village.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:50.040
"Please assume the guardianship of To Eigetsu, as there is something I must do.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.790
Now that Seika village is deserted, I am setting out on a journey."

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:56.380
Deserted?

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.720
Seika village no longer exists.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:02.170
Except for those two, the entire village

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.170
was wiped out a few years ago by a certain disease.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:10.370
I have invited you this time,

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:12.460
because I have something that I want to pass on to you.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:14.680
Something to pass on to me?

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:21.630
Though I was delayed by some business, I was about to go to Kiyou for New Year's greetings.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.160
A person visited me.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:44.420
Thank you... for being Eigetsu's... guardian.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:46.470
Doushu-sama.

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:53.330
I... wrote them.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:57.350
They will... be useful.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:59.980
Are they for Eigetsu?

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:01.970
No.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:07.740
For the other Sashuu governor... for Kou Shuurei-dono.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.450
For me?

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:13.450
So what I received...

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:14.820
were these.

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:27.680
A medical book.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:29.990
All these?!

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:31.550
Yes.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:36.050
Why me... instead of Eigetsu?

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.170
I do not understand the circumstances.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:43.130
I will repeat what that person said to me word for word.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:48.320
"Eigetsu does not have much time left either.

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:53.700
Therefore, instead of Eigetsu,

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:57.390
I am passing the medical books on to the other Sashuu governor,

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.220
who will carry out Eigetsu's and my wish."

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:00.710
Eigetsu-kun...

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:08.360
"Please pass these words to Governor Kou, who has been with him since the national exam.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:15.580
The only thing that worried me was that boy being alone again after leaving Seika village,

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:16.970
but I was relieved.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:21.980
I would like to thank you from my heart for keeping Eigetsu company.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:29.010
Also, not long from now, To Eigetsu will disappear from this world."

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:39.290
Eigetsu-kun seemed to rush everthing in his life,

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:44.630
saying odd things like, "Because life is short."

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:50.540
There are old men of 80 or more, who live free from care,

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:53.260
and yet a child like him says such things.

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.830
I don't really understand it myself.

00:06:57.590 --> 00:06:59.270
Did Doushu-sama say anything else?

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:05.610
No, after he said all that he looked relieved, as though he had put down a heavy load.

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:10.610
I have finished my entire journey.

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.140
Now I just want a quiet...

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.040
Hold on, I will call someone.

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:19.900
Just hold on!

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:31.180
I have brought a doctor.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:40.100
I searched for him everywhere with all my might,

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.330
but not a trace.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:44.660
The way he looked then, he is probably...

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.750
Excuse me for interrupting your conversation.

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:51.540
Urgent letters for Governor Kou.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.540
This is from Eigetsu-kun,

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.290
and the other is from Ensei.

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:01.340
They are together. Why two?

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:04.850
A crimson provincial seal?!

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.250
This is the first time I've seen one, but this must be it.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.530
Yes, it's the fastest method you can use, but it's only for emergencies.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:20.720
What does it say?

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:24.990
In Sashuu's Koringun, a strange disease is spreading,

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.980
and Eigetsu-kun has headed that way alone.

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:28.480
A disease?

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:33.020
In addition, a sect named Jyasen-kyou is taking advantage of the disease

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:35.350
and scaring the villagers.

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:37.740
The founder of the sect...

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.250
is called Senya.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.370
Governor Kou.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.760
If I recall correctly, the sector in charge of medicine is...

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:52.790
The most important one is the Taijyou Temple medical sector.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:57.890
Bring a copy of these two letters to the Emperor,

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:01.560
and at the same time call for Officer Tei.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:04.970
Also, immediately inform the Taijyou Temple director

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:07.300
that Sashuu Governor Kou requests an urgent meeting,

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.690
and summon Tou-roushi and the other higher court physicians.

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:11.280
I-I understand, Governor.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:17.930
Some sort of lead...

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:20.130
It will be there... in these.

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:25.980
Governor Kai, I would like to thank you from my heart for delivering this to me.

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:29.610
Is there anything I can do for you?

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:33.710
Only if I may be selfish.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.220
Anything, please.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:41.220
Well, when this matter is settled, if I have been replaced as governor of Sashuu,

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.230
will you become the next governor of Sashuu?

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:52.030
You are saying that you need my help.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:52.880
Yes.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:10:00.130
I understand. Let me write a letter.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:11.570
I will continue what you and Governor To are trying to protect

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:13.640
by risking your positions as governors.

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:15.670
Please do not worry about it.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:19.600
Thank you very much.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:22.500
The youkan and the tea were both delicious.

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:25.680
Please have tea with me again.

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:27.180
Without fail.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.670
Well, please excuse me now.

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:46.770
If a lady invites me for tea, I must not be late, no matter what.

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.970
Eigetsu, that fool!

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:53.380
Why did he go there alone, especially at a busy time like this?!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:57.090
If he was going, he could at least have told me before he left!

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.260
Would you have approved if he'd told you?

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.260
Well I would've stopped him, but...

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:04.940
Huh, so that's why!

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:08.410
A commission transferring powers to Officer Rou?!

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:13.920
Now I can't get away from Koren Palace!

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:17.480
Kourin Jyou-chan says nothing either. What the hell!

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.520
Be quiet, Officer Rou!

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:24.190
Have a look at that.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.890
I've only summarized the reports we've received back,

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:28.750
but we don't have enough doctors or medicine at all!

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:32.440
In Sekiei village, half the villagers have died already.

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:37.800
There are reports of patients coming down with similar symptoms in neighboring villages too!

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.760
We'd better negotiate with the Kiyou Merchants Guild.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.780
Of course, the costs will be paid at public expense.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:48.480
You better think of a good excuse to the central government for running up a massive debt.

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:52.300
Fine! I'll charge them to my great-grandchildren's generation.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.080
Petition rejected! You can't borrow a penny like that!

00:11:56.760 --> 00:12:00.420
Once in several decades, when winter arrives earlier than usual,

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:02.240
a monster arises from water.

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:03.990
Wh-What?

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:07.920
A saying of the people in Sekiei village, apparently.

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.500
Most likely, this kind of disease has always been around,

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.750
and the saying was passed on as a tradition.

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:15.600
Has always been around?

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:20.590
The villagers fear it as a disease caused by fate and never discuss it openly.

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:25.510
They just pray and hide until the matter is resolved naturally.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:32.020
I see... a monster from water, huh?

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:46.230
Governor To!

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:51.480
Are you Governor To?

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:53.540
You must be Hei-Taishu!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.750
I've heard of you from Ensei-san.

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:57.250
Nice to meet you.

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:59.990
We have no time for greetings.

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:02.930
Why did you come here by yourself?!

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:03.750
That was thoughtless!

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:04.900
I know!

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:10.300
Even so, right now I'm the person who knows most about this disease.

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:15.890
I judged that I could be of more help if I came and talked to you directly.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:27.160
As mentioned previously in the letter, the disease is probably carried by snow foxes.

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:29.560
It's true the winter came early this year,

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:34.990
and snow foxes were spotted near the Senri Mountains at the end of autumn.

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:40.040
Presumably, something carried by the snow foxes brings disease to humans.

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:43.670
But snow foxes are wary of humans.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:46.800
It's said they have hardly any contact with people.

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:50.260
Even without direct contact with snow foxes,

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:54.190
the villagers could have consumed something that came from snow foxes.

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:59.900
These are the words from the head of the Seika village, where I used to live.

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:05.060
"If winter arrives earlier than usual, a monster arises from water."

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:08.370
Ah, I read that in the letter.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:10.070
So it's the water.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:16.090
In small villages, everyone uses the same river or well all the time for drinking water.

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:19.580
If a fox dropped that "something" in the water source...

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:26.140
We can tell that this is not a contagious disease, because it occurs at separate locations.

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:31.050
Probably, this is because the water containing "something" is consumed at different times.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:34.680
That's why you told us to boil the water before use.

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:40.690
Yes, aquatic organisms tend to be resistant to cold, but are vulnerable to heat.

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:45.440
Boiling the water should be a very effective method of prevention.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:47.710
There have been no reports of the disease so far

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:51.860
in the areas where they strictly followed your instructions about prevention.

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:53.320
I'm glad to hear that.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:57.570
If you know that much, perhaps you know the cure too?

00:14:59.290 --> 00:14:59.940
There...

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:05.110
Of course, I guess not to that extent.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:05.710
There is...

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:10.520
Eigetsu...

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:15.720
I will definitely find the cause and cure of this disease.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:20.220
For as long as this life, the half of your soul that you gave me, lasts.

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:21.990
Doushu-sama.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:29.470
A cure definitely exists. It will arrive from the capital.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.510
Until then, it's my duty to do my best.

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:35.160
Please help me!

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:41.620
Well, if Governor To says so, we'll wait for it to arrive.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:46.020
By the way, it wouldn't be Governor Kou who's coming from the capital, would it?

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.030
Is there anything wrong if it is Governor Kou?

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:54.900
I've sent a letter to Officer Rou, but it must've crossed your path.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:56.320
What's going on?

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:58.150
What about Governor Kou?

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:05.060
Well, I guess the message would've reached Governor Kou by now...

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.360
Jyasen-kyou, huh?

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:16.450
They're saying to the villagers, "If you join us, you won't contract the strange disease."

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:21.230
Well, whenever a natural disaster or epidemic causes social unrest,

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:24.710
it's common for groups like this to appear,

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:30.030
but saying the cause is that the governor is a woman, meaning you, is a bit far-fetched.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:32.710
It's so stupid, it makes me laugh.

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:35.430
No, perhaps because it is so stupid,

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:39.880
it resonates better with people who have lost their perspective.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.310
Particularly in the remote villages among the mountains,

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:45.100
where it's difficult to obtain accurate information.

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:50.690
Ah, it's true this occurred during the first winter after my arrival.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:54.660
Perhaps you shouldn't worry about this, but...

00:16:55.500 --> 00:17:00.990
"To resolve this, capture the woman-governor and offer her as a sacrifice."

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.100
That's creepy.

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:04.170
It wouldn't hurt to be cautious about this.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:05.120
Yes...

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:06.310
Excuse me.

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:09.370
Everyone has arrived.

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:26.610
You must be the director of the Taijyou Temple medical sector.

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:29.190
I am Sashuu Governor Kou Shuurei.

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:32.010
This is Officer Tei Yuushun.

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:37.570
I've heard of what the two of you have achieved, of course.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:41.030
If someone such as Governor Kou requires an urgent meeting,

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:44.700
no matter how busy you are, you can do nothing but comply.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:48.630
I apologize. I understand deeply that you are pressed with work,

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:52.090
but please consider this to have the highest priority over anything else.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:58.210
Ah, umm, you must be Tou Roushi-sama?

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:00.480
You are...

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:09.230
I know. Now, state your business.

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:11.050
Thank you.

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:14.970
Well, we'll get down to business right away.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.860
The reason why I asked all of you here is because...

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:33.330
A swelling of the belly and fever from unknown cause and excessive sweating...

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:36.740
I have heard of it before.

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:41.470
If I remember correctly, such a disease spreads now and then among the remote villages in the mountains.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:46.470
Actually, I received these books from someone.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.060
Please, have a look at them yourselves.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:18:59.650
No way?!

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:02.400
A-A medical book of this quality...

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:03.930
A prescription like this!

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.390
Splendid...

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:07.390
Wh-Who wrote this?

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:11.420
Kashin?

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:12.910
No, it can't be.

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:15.170
That Kashin?!

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:18.600
Kashin? You mean a descendant of that legendary doctor,

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.550
Kada-roushi of the Ka family?!

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:22.430
Could it be Kashin the child prodigy?

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:27.290
B-But he refused to be a court physician for the previous emperor,

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:29.930
and then one day he disappeared.

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:38.400
You understand the value of these medical books far better than me.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:39.780
So here is my wish.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:45.020
Please share the task of searching these books for the article that matches the symptoms Governor To described to us,

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:46.410
and find the cure!

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:48.400
Without delay, please!

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:51.200
We'll be able to find it in half a day.

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:55.040
We'll call on all doctors who are free, immediately.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:06.300
And director, I would like to ask your approval to dispatch court physicians to Sashuu.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.310
I understand the circumstances,

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:13.370
but except to accompany the Emperor on his travels,

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:15.930
no court physician has ever gone independently to a province.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:18.600
If that's the case, then make this the first time!

00:20:19.060 --> 00:20:20.440
I will take all responsibility.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.950
Responsibility, you say?

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:28.580
So what if Governor Kou takes responsibility, huh?

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:38.040
In the name of Sashuu Governor Kou Shuurei,

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.380
I demand that the director of Taijyou Temple medical sector

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:43.880
approve the immediate dispatch of the best medical team!

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:50.200
Fine.

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:55.720
If you only want an approval, but I cannot do anything more.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:21:00.990
Ah, and in passing, would you kindly negotiate with other medical sectors and send them?

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:06.450
You have connections to transport teams as well.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.810
Please prepare twenty fast carriages for departure in four days.

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:12.110
Officer Tei, you ask me for that much?

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:15.940
I tend to ask for everything I can get.

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:21.570
You say a team of medics, but I can't send out that many!

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:24.600
You never know what might happen to the Emperor and when.

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:27.240
Tou-roushi is out of the question!

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:28.640
As much as you can do would be fine.

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:37.980
I understand. I'll do it.

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:44.850
So is Governor Kou going to return to Sashuu again?

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:47.480
Yes, I'm returning immediately.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:53.120
You're not afraid of the disease?

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:56.890
There are plenty of people who can replace me.

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:05.250
To Sekiei village?!

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:07.660
Yes, I'm leaving at once.

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:08.770
Farewell.

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:16.300
Shuurei-san will come for sure.

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:20.480
She will, no matter what people say.

00:22:21.130 --> 00:22:24.430
She will definitely arrive in Koringun with medicine and doctors.

00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:27.530
Shuurei-san is that kind of person.

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:34.290
Hei-Taishu, I swear Shuurei-san is not the cause of this disease.

00:22:34.840 --> 00:22:36.040
Yes, of course.

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:39.970
But... if Jyasen-kyou is spreading a rumor like that,

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:42.040
and more people come to believe it,

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:45.920
it's even more probable that Shuurei-san will come to resolve this matter...

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:49.110
even if she knows what might happen to her.

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:54.800
Governor To.

00:22:56.010 --> 00:22:56.300
Yes?

00:22:57.100 --> 00:22:58.470
Could you promise me?

00:22:59.210 --> 00:23:02.810
Not to push yourself too hard, and to be sure to return here?

00:23:04.740 --> 00:23:06.280
I will do my very best.

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:11.320
No matter what happens from now on, please stand by Shuurei-san.

00:24:45.600 --> 00:24:47.130
Eigetsu-kun is going to disappear?

00:24:47.750 --> 00:24:49.210
There's an outbreak of disease in Sashuu?

00:24:49.740 --> 00:24:54.960
There's a cure in Eigetsu-kun's book, but it's not an easy one?!

00:24:55.390 --> 00:24:57.550
What on earth is going on?!
